comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T19:42:44.895Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all 2,136 items for linked-test context none, source-workspace opt-out, file governance, coverage, and validation. Reused pm-vrsn as canonical implemented lineage; no existing item covers an explicit no-source-workspace mode. Discovered while closing PR #777 review evidence; direct coverage passed all 6,428 tests at 100/100/100/100, while two linked attempts deterministically failed validate file-scan and merge-receipt fixtures because execution_context retained the source workspace."
  "2026-08-22T16:34:36.185Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-22: actively implementing the explicit source-workspace isolation half of the coupled linked-test context/trust tranche. This item is claimed because its metadata and runtime surface will change; unrelated quality items remain open and unclaimed."
  "2026-08-22T18:26:48.315Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence 2026-08-22: isolated mode strips PM_SOURCE_* injection while retaining the source cwd; snapshot mode copies the source tree into the protected sandbox, excludes tracker/Git state, binds the sandbox tracker, and leaves the original checkout unchanged. Focused integration tests and the manual temporary-workspace proof passed; full suite passed 7,794 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
